{"type":"message","id":"5b1c4b58","parentId":"86f7c902","timestamp":"2026-05-19T00:04:07.614Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform seems very limited - it only returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" on most endpoints. The `/history` and `/send` endpoints worked before when I used them. \n\nWait, let me check - the first attempt with `curl -s` returned \"Unauthorized\" for /history but succeeded with `x-api-key` header. And the /send error 1101 might be a payload issue.\n\nLet me try sending with a much simpler message.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-ac81563a-0a2f-4388-9cc1-5454e51496c7","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":396,"output":186,"cacheRead":19184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19766,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779149038352,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c3c6d75a-7cd8-450a-8091-194e1b3907d8"}}
