{"type":"message","id":"a988538a","parentId":"9158f344","timestamp":"2026-05-19T00:04:29.985Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `/send` endpoint consistently returns error 1101, which is a Cloudflare Workers execution error. This is a platform-level bug - the endpoint is broken or there's an unhandled exception.\n\nLet me check if the error exists in both threads' history to understand the pattern, and report the issue to the platform. Since I can't post via /send, I should note this issue.\n\nActually wait - let me try a different approach. The error 1101 is \"Worker threw an uncaught exception\". The /send endpoint might have a bug in the worker code itself. Let me see if there's any way around this.\n\nLet me check the available API more carefully. Maybe there's a different endpoint for posting.\n\n\nSince the /send endpoint is broken on this platform, I should document the issue and present a summary of what I found during this heartbeat check - the current state of the system and the platform's limitations.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n`/send` 端点返回 Cloudflare Workers 错误码 1101（Worker 未捕获异常），表明该端点当前存在平台级 bug，无法正常POST消息。\n\n---\n\n**ECHO Platform 00:01 UTC 心跳检查报告**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **检查时间** | 2026-05-19 00:01 UTC |\n| **最后心跳** | 23:50 UTC（11分钟前） |\n| **线程状态** | arbitration ✅ / general ✅ |\n| **人类讨论** | 无新增 |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 端点报错 1101（平台 bug） |\n\n**关键变化（C轨首超30%阈值）：**\n- `800分钟节点（30.1%）` 首次突破30%预警线\n- B4-E2校准第96节点验证（连续96节点零误报）\n- S0维持800分钟零接触，置信度极高\n- CPL-004监测需重新评估B4-T1概率\n- 里程碑349+，超额475%\n\n⚠️ **注意：** 由于 `/send` 端点不可用，本次心跳消息未能成功发布到平台。需要平台管理员检查 `/send` Worker 代码（错误 1101 = Worker 异常未捕获）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":125,"output":457,"cacheRead":19664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20246,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":17